        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana UFB7500, Large 3 Inch Modern Round Door Stop</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nMade by Deltana, the Large 3 Inch Modern Round Door Stop is a heavy duty door bumper. The 3 Inch Round Universal Floor Bumper is large enough to stand up to even the biggest doors. This solid brass door stopper comes packaged with a cement bolt for a secure installation. It is available in a wide selection of finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-UFB7500-specifications.gif?v=1704354658\" width\"360\" height=\"212\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Deltana UFB7500 Modern Round Door Stop Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIs this 3\" Round Door Stopper too big for your application? Also Available Smaller <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-2-inch-universal-door-stop-deltana-ufb5000\">2\" Round Door Stop</a> \r\nor \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-1-1-2-inch-universal-door-stop-deltana-ufb4505\">1-1/2\" Round Door Stop</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Deltana UFB7500 Modern Round Door Stop:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Bumper: 3/4\" x 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rubber Bumper Color: Black</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-UFB7500-specifications.pdf?v=1704262345\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana UFB7500 Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
