                "description": "Made by Deltana, the Large 3 Inch Modern Round Door Stop is a heavy duty door bumper. The 3 Inch Round Universal Floor Bumper is large enough to stand up to even the biggest doors. This solid brass door stopper comes packaged with a cement bolt for a secure installation. It is available in a wide selection of finishes.",
